1
00:00:00,327 --> 00:00:04,437
(Raj:)-Dude, I'm so sorry.
-Don't take this the wrong way,

2
00:00:04,598 --> 00:00:07,168
(Howard:)but did you do this
for the insurance money?

3
00:00:07,334 --> 00:00:10,574
(Stuart:)No. God, you sound
like the police, the firemen,

4
00:00:10,738 --> 00:00:13,448
(Stuart:)my parents, my therapist
and the insurance company.

5
00:00:15,109 --> 00:00:17,349
(Raj:)We're here for you, man.
Whatever you need, okay?

6
00:00:17,511 --> 00:00:20,251
(Stuart:)Actually, I was wondering if I could
crash at your place for a few nights.

7
00:00:20,414 --> 00:00:23,414
(Raj:)Sure, of course. Oh, actually,
Emily was gonna spend the night.

8
00:00:24,285 --> 00:00:26,425
(Stuart:)You slept with her? Nice.

9
00:00:26,587 --> 00:00:30,157
(Raj:)Well, I can't take all the credit.
She let me do it to her, but...

10
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,930
(Raj:)But I can always
call her and cancel.

11
00:00:35,095 --> 00:00:37,375
(Howard:)Hang on.
I know a place you can stay,

12
00:00:37,531 --> 00:00:39,531
(Howard:)and earn some money at the same time.

13
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,540
(Amy:)-Great.
-I just have to warn you,

14
00:00:41,702 --> 00:00:45,552
(Howard:)it'll involve humiliation,
degradation and verbal abuse.

15
00:00:46,841 --> 00:00:55,021
(Stuart:)So what's the catch?

